      "standardized_narrative": "Opening gross claims outstanding at 1 January 2020 were GBP 1,683.7m. During 2020 the syndicate recorded a net favourable run-off (release) of c.GBP 20.1m, driven principally by favourable claims development in several direct lines (notably improvements in Credit and Political Crisis, Casualty and Marine) but partially offset by adverse development from single large losses in Reinsurance and Energy and the material impacts of the 2020 catastrophe season and COVID-19. The reported prior year movement used here is the net run-off deviation disclosed in the notes (net of reinsurance) because no explicit gross prior year movement was presented in the extract.",
